<title>GERMANY: German Jan M3 grew annualised 11.7 pct vs Q4 96.</title>
<headline>German Jan M3 grew annualised 11.7 pct vs Q4 96.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank gave the following data for German M3 money supply growth in January</p>
<p>						  Jan  96	  Dec 95</p>
<p> Annualised vs average Q4 1996	    11.7 pct	 n/a</p>
<p> Annualised vs average Q4 1995	    8.6 pct	  7.9</p>
<p> Non-annualised vs average Q4 1996	1.9 pct	  n/a</p>
<p>Note - The Bundesbank's target range for 1996 M3 money supply growth was four percent to seven percent. For 1997, it has set a range of 3-1/2 to 6-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
